CL_SetAnalogMove; CL_iOS_PassiveState/Disconnected/LayoutActive; CL_iOS_LookDelta/LookAnalog
(bypass sensitivity/accel; controller look 1.3x); CL_iOS_WheelCursor (touch wheel cursor-
follows-finger); CL_Wheel_Input by direction for the stick. patch -p1 -d vendor/q2repro < this

